  "orbit": 2,
  "name": "Rim Echo Lattice",
  "desc": "Sparse rim, clave and cowbell hits whose delay time re-tunes every cycle (<.375 .25 .167>s) so the echoes weave a shifting polyrhythmic lattice over the groove. Dry hits stay loud; ${fb} sets the lattice density.",
